        "uuid": "f24f9586_6c2a4051",
        "filename": "thread/framework/java/android/net/thread/ActiveOperationalDataset.java",
        "patchSetId": 27
      },
      "lineNbr": 204,
      "author": {
        "id": 1501262
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-10-16T01:07:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If GMS Core wants to call attach(), I think it needs to convert the credentials to Android platform API\u0027s ActiveOperationalDataset. Without this API, do we have other APIs to do the converision?",
      "parentUuid": "92b88f40_8cb85693",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 204,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 204,
        "endChar": 10
      },
      "revId": "a6a7d4cbf3b80bcfde01378d02d91fa46ad9eea2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "3efe428b_630d27d5",
        "filename": "thread/framework/java/android/net/thread/ActiveOperationalDataset.java",
        "patchSetId": 27
      },
      "lineNbr": 204,
      "author": {
        "id": 1693933
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-10-17T02:35:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Without this API, GMS Core will need to parse the TLVs and set the parameters one by one. The problem is that, either it will loss an unrecognized TLV (added in later versions) or we need to expose `ActiveOperationalDataset.Builder.setUnknownTlvs()`.",
      "parentUuid": "f24f9586_6c2a4051",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 204,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 204,
        "endChar": 10
      },
      "revId": "a6a7d4cbf3b80bcfde01378d02d91fa46ad9eea2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c284f145_8c3ff231",
        "filename": "thread/framework/java/android/net/thread/ActiveOperationalDataset.java",
        "patchSetId": 27
